{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052760/extras/b812f0b0b1e2b29762ece01cefa7c58c.poster.avif?t=1770036771\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052760/extras/b812f0b0b1e2b29762ece01cefa7c58c.webm?t=1770036771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052760/extras/b812f0b0b1e2b29762ece01cefa7c58c.mp4?t=1770036771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>Let us take you on a trip to various spots on the globe and experience true architectural variety. You will try to build a mud hut in Africa, an igloo in the Arctic, a Canadian house, a log cabin in Siberia, a traditional house made of bricks, air bricks, or concrete, and many, many more\u2026 Every house consists of hundreds of elements you need to match according to the rules of construction. <strong>Now in VR to fully dive into the action!</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052760/extras/b5ce2c62af8228131dced53236774837.poster.avif?t=1770036771\" width=600 height=150 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052760/extras/b5ce2c62af8228131dced53236774837.webm?t=1770036771\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2052760/extras/b5ce2c62af8228131dced53236774837.mp4?t=1770036771\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>See how construction technologies differ from each other. Learn how to apply proper materials and procedures during the building process.<br>Build houses brick by brick, element after element, down from the foundations and up to the roof. Learn different structures of buildin